# Prevent git CRLF conversion from corrupting LightGBM model text files.
# LightGBM's parser fails with "Model format error, expect a tree here"
# when LF line endings in *.txt model files are silently converted to CRLF
# by git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true). Marking these as binary disables
# the conversion — this is the root cause of the STATUS_STACK_BUFFER_OVERRUN
# CI failure observed on the Windows dev machine.
models/**/*.txt  binary
models/**/*.onnx binary
